{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00061","headline":"溪上遇雨二首 · 崔道融","name":"溪上遇雨二首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回塘雨脚如缫丝，野禽不起沈鱼飞。 耕蓑钓笠取未暇，秋田有望从淋漓。 坐看黑云衔猛雨，喷洒前山此独晴。 忽惊云雨在头上，却是山前晚照明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔道融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「溪上遇雨二首」条，撰者周啸天、与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"周啸天"}